		<r3d:repositoryName language="eng">West African Vegetation</r3d:repositoryName>
				<r3d:additionalName language="eng">A vegetation data network for West Africa</r3d:additionalName>
				<r3d:repositoryUrl>http://www.westafricanvegetation.org/menu/home.aspx</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">This is a database for vegetation data from West Africa, i.e. phytosociological and dendrometric relevés as well as floristic inventories. The West African Vegetation Database has been developed in the framework of the projects “SUN - Sustainable Use of Natural Vegetation in West Africa”  and “Biodiversity Transect Analysis in Africa” (BIOTA, https://www.biota-africa.org/).</r3d:description>
